        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5e843d55-e4b7-3884-83f6-67e4d17c22d5",
                "word": "morefold",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd5d935a-6d86-33c7-820f-beb8de62c675",
                        "entry_id": "5e843d55-e4b7-3884-83f6-67e4d17c22d5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Being greater than one in number; plural; multiple; multiplex; manifold."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01a693a2-7a0e-4a71-8e8d-a1ab3a195533",
                                "sense_id": "bd5d935a-6d86-33c7-820f-beb8de62c675",
                                "text": "The base-curves Br, Bs, Bt and Bu of the pencils are morefold curves of the surface L."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c8ecbca-7c8b-4f74-99cd-abe9f09c79d1",
                                "sense_id": "bd5d935a-6d86-33c7-820f-beb8de62c675",
                                "text": "In the case of a morefold coordinated complex a MOcrossing of occupied and unoccupied orbitals takes place, with the consequence that electrons enter molecular orbitals where antibonding 2n*—functions of the CO-molecule are […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f819831e-4128-4dd5-b064-4abc96884e7b",
                                "sense_id": "bd5d935a-6d86-33c7-820f-beb8de62c675",
                                "text": "The argument mentioned at 1166a35, that friendship with oneself is possible only so far as one is two or morefold (heesti duo epleid), has had its authenticity doubted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aacda53b-4f30-4b7a-b60f-51a6bffd5612",
                                "sense_id": "bd5d935a-6d86-33c7-820f-beb8de62c675",
                                "text": "The most important property of these continua for our present purpose, for whose sake alone they are here investigated, is that the relations of the twofold ones may be geometrically represented by surfaces, and of the morefold ones may be reduced to those of the surfaces included in them; which now requires a short further discussion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0858d575-247d-41fa-b121-9b3ff1c760cf",
                                "sense_id": "bd5d935a-6d86-33c7-820f-beb8de62c675",
                                "text": "Besides morefold anionic domino processes with one pericyclic reaction, domino sequences combining two initiating anionic with two pericyclic steps have also been developed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
